    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=563645721060836147&sectionId=563645721162548019)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gszYGqLzOBmUe_text","label":"gszYGqLzOBmUe_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">27% of 50,000+ FloraFresh Queens </span>Were Handed It by Partners—Because a Happy Vagina Beats Socks Any Day!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW-012vfCx_text","label":"ggW-012vfCx_text","default":"<p><strong>WHAT'S THAT SMELL!</strong> FloraFresh engages <strong>all the senses</strong> perfectly. Light herbal scent, <strong>no harsh odors</strong> within days, just <strong>delicate freshness</strong>. <strong>No irritation, no residue</strong>, pure comfort. This is a <strong>breath of fresh air</strong> for intimate care!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-vOUgUPxG_text","label":"gg-vOUgUPxG_text","default":"Donna s."},{"type":"html","id":"gg0-zp_caeN_text","label":"gg0-zp_caeN_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUhQAg9oez_text","label":"ggUhQAg9oez_text","default":"<p>Wow—<strong>just wow</strong>. FloraFresh <strong>worked within 48 hours</strong> to eliminate an odor I'd been battling for months. 😍 Now I feel fresh, clean, and unstoppable. My confidence is through the roof! This is <strong>my secret weapon</strong> from here on out. If you want instant results, look no further — FloraFresh delivers.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZNt5fKF0G_text","label":"ggZNt5fKF0G_text","default":"<p>Maria T.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggts9bCbz2b_text","label":"ggts9bCbz2b_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Aj9Fn5J3_text","label":"gg8Aj9Fn5J3_text","default":"<p>I'm giving this a round of applause! Battled embarrassing odor for years—doctors, treatments, nothing worked. Coworkers started commenting. I was <strong>crushed</strong>. Found FloraFresh and <strong>this stuff delivers!</strong> Worked in one day. Nearly cried with gratitude. No more paranoia, just <strong>pure relief</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRUVyZDoAx_text","label":"ggRUVyZDoAx_text","default":"<p>Kimberly L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNjLfIrqK_text","label":"ggrNjLfIrqK_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","label":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","default":"<p>Try FloraFresh Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","label":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","label":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","default":"<p>The Silent Epidemic Striking Women Over 20 That No One Talks About: <span style=\"color:#EB5D46;\">Crippling Hydration Loss</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","label":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","default":"<p>New studies reveal that women over 20 experience <strong>decreased production of collagen and hyaluronic acid</strong>, essential substances that maintain moisture and hydration levels in vaginal tissue ([1]).</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPWX5sY6PI_text","label":"ggPWX5sY6PI_text","default":"<p>As women age, this decline leads to thinner and less lubricated vaginal walls, causing persistent itching, dryness, and irritation.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpB3NPleQ__text","label":"ggpB3NPleQ__text","default":"<p>To combat this issue, formulations containing probiotic and prebiotic blends, such as <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\"><strong>FloraFresh</strong></span>, have been developed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghtU5QJ_fb_text","label":"gghtU5QJ_fb_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh includes probiotic strains specifically chosen for their benefits to vaginal health: <span style=\"color:#D76C95;\"><i>Lactobacillus salivarius, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus reuteri, and Lactobacillus gasseri</i></span> (15 billion CFUs per serving), combined with prebiotic xylooligosaccharides (XOS) and D-Mannose to promote the growth of beneficial vaginal bacteria and support hydration and comfort.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGAS5yfwYH_text","label":"ggGAS5yfwYH_text","default":"<p>Graphs beside clearly demonstrate how levels of collagen ([2])...</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_bU-NYYc9_text","label":"gg_bU-NYYc9_text","default":"<p>...and hyaluronic acid ([3])&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ8h7rE2cd_text","label":"ggQ8h7rE2cd_text","default":"<p>...and hyaluronic acid ([3]) naturally decline after age 20, emphasizing the importance of proactive vaginal care.&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-d1xiFiwb_text","label":"gg-d1xiFiwb_text","default":"<p>naturally decline after age 20, emphasizing the importance of proactive vaginal care.</p>"}],
